{"about_the_game":"Gracia is a platform that redefines virtual reality, offering free-viewpoint ultra-photorealistic VR experiences. It's not just about seeing; it's about stepping inside a volumetric photo with freedom to walk around, where every detail is so vivid, you'll forget it's virtual.<br><br><strong>Key features:</strong><br><br>- Unmatched Photorealism: Gracia\u2019s advanced rendering technology blurs the line between virtual and reality and creates a feeling as if you are inside high-resolution photograph. <br>- 6DOF Volumetric Scenes: Move and interact within our scenes with complete freedom as if you were really there.<br>- Extremely High Fidelity: Up to 550 fps at native resolution.<br>- User-Generated Content: Publish your own PLY scenes on Gracia, enhancing the platform's collection <br>- Ever Expanding Collection of Scenes: Regular updates keep the content fresh and exciting.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2802520?t=1750237134","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802520/78cf7e94d246eb4f0dff47d0f02544e1c66db8e7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750237134","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802520/5e405891f7722dd44506796c878140a7952a41b8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750237134","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802520/5e405891f7722dd44506796c878140a7952a41b8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750237134","categories":[{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Only","id":54}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"Gracia is a platform that redefines virtual reality, offering free-viewpoint ultra-photorealistic VR experiences. It's not just about seeing; it's about stepping inside a volumetric photo with freedom to walk around, where every detail is so vivid, you'll forget it's virtual.<br><br><strong>Key features:</strong><br><br>- Unmatched Photorealism: Gracia\u2019s advanced rendering technology blurs the line between virtual and reality and creates a feeling as if you are inside high-resolution photograph. <br>- 6DOF Volumetric Scenes: Move and interact within our scenes with complete freedom as if you were really there.<br>- Extremely High Fidelity: Up to 550 fps at native resolution.<br>- User-Generated Content: Publish your own PLY scenes on Gracia, enhancing the platform's collection <br>- Ever Expanding Collection of Scenes: Regular updates keep the content fresh and exciting.","developers":["Gracia"],"ext_user_account_notice":"Gracia ","genres":[{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Utilities","id":"57"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802520/3bbf565d66d5ad1defcb5fc3428928e044e6425b/header.jpg?t=1750237134","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2802520/704030/24a4d9945fdabb659ac7132ad5f75e36c9b9832d/1750901489/dash_av1.mpd?t=1716473785","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2802520/704030/24a4d9945fdabb659ac7132ad5f75e36c9b9832d/1750901489/dash_h264.mpd?t=1716473785","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2802520/704030/24a4d9945fdabb659ac7132ad5f75e36c9b9832d/1750901489/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1716473785","id":257025301,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257025301/movie480.mp4?t=1716473785","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257025301/movie_max.mp4?t=1716473785"},"name":"Gracia trailer","thumbnail":"https://share